{{Quote|Now, would one of you please explain where the rest of my actual reinforcements are?''"<br />"''Rerouted to the capital. We're all you're getting.|Depa Billaba and Hunter|<ref name="TBB" />}}
A '''location''' served as the [[capital]] for the [[planet]] [[Kaller]]. During [[Clone Wars]] between the [[Galactic Republic]] and the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], the latter controlled the capital<ref name="TBB" /> by [[19 BBY]].<ref name="Date">"Aftermath" begins concurrently with [[Order 66]], which ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates to [[19 BBY]].</ref> That [[Standard year|year]], during
the [[Battle of Kaller]], [[Jedi Master]] [[Depa Billaba]]'s reinforcements were rerouted to the capital of the planet, leaving [[Clone Force 99]] as the only unit aiding Billaba's [[Depa Billaba's second battalion|battalion]] in their fight against the [[Separatist Droid Army]]. After the<ref name="TBB" /> [[special forces]]<ref name="S7">{{TCW|The Bad Batch (episode)}}</ref> [[squad]] arrived to assist them, Billaba inquired as to where the rest of her reinforcements were, and the squad's leader, [[Hunter]], replied that his five-man unit was the only assistance she was getting.<ref name="TBB" />

